   169	          # First version at which pre-GA waivers are no longer honest.
   170	          # Bump DOWN (or empty the waiver lists) once an adopter ships.
   650	      # known AFTER the verdict commit lands). v1.16.0 GA bridged via
   651	      # CEO_PAIR_RAIL_VERDICT_OPTIONAL=1 transition mode. The replacement
   652	      # binds to parent_sha — the commit the verdict was generated
   653	      # against (parent of the verdict-file commit). That value is
   654	      # observable + immutable when the verdict is authored.
