  1009	# ---- E9-F10 (iii): VERSION-string coherence ----
  1010	# Anchored to the current-version DECLARATION sites ONLY (not historical
  1011	# CHANGELOG prose). Each (doc, regex) yields the literal version string, which
  1012	# must equal the live VERSION file. npm/package.json is read here (it is not in
  1013	# DOCS). A doc with zero matches contributes no violation.
